  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blueprint Ivorian Women of Green Growth (IWCG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project facilitates a two-day POWER DESIGN SPRINT with the objective to create a blueprint for a constellation (network/platform) for the Ivorian Women of Green Growth. In addition, three small activities will be executed to test the ideas generated in the design sprint and allow for more data upon which to design a larger multi-annual programme.These activities will:1.	Build: provide the first capacity building to entrepreneurs, leaders and role models,2.	Connect: organise a networking event to establish connections and a platform to share knowledge,3.	Lead: equip female leaders in green growth through leadership programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
